{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15235080","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15235080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1523508001:0":{"text":"はぁ……どうにか……命だけは助かった……","source_cn":"呼……总算……总算捡回了一条命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D72767AF9B0C250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1523508002:1":{"text":"ホーリン城……なんて恐ろしい場所なの！戦争後の混乱が続いてると知ってたら、来なかったのに……","source_cn":"呼临城……真是太可怕了！早知道战争后呼临城大乱，我就不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC7F9DD83857A99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523508003:0":{"text":"ごほん……異郷の学者よ、余がホーリン城の領主だ。","source_cn":"咳嗯……外来的学者，你好！我是呼临城的领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D522105B6CFA037","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1523508004:1":{"text":"以前話していたビターラギの改良の件だが……資料、種、実験用の農地、すべて準備は整っておる。","source_cn":"关于之前提到的苦苞穗改良的研究，所有的资料、种子和实验...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C687E34882A36BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523508005:1":{"text":"そなたのタイミングで、いつでも研究を開始してくれ！","source_cn":"如果你愿意的话，随时可以开始研究！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22AEF6023ECE524B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1523508006:1":{"text":"嫌です……お断りします！","source_cn":"不——我不愿意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21A7B619640F8734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523508007:1":{"text":"よし、では最高の待遇で出迎えを……えっ？そ、そなた今、何と？","source_cn":"很好！呼临城会以最高待遇……啊？你、你不愿意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6892F2AA1BF40943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523508008:1":{"text":"到着したと思ったらいきなり拉致されて……こんな場所に誰がいたいと思いますか！？","source_cn":"我刚到你们呼临城，就被那个谋逆的家伙绑架，差点丢了性命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788E46E142F72034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1523508009:1":{"text":"もう研究もやりたくありません。今すぐシーラ城に帰らせてください！","source_cn":"你说的那个研究我不想做了，我现在只想回希莱城！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EF8A6500247834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1523508010:1":{"text":"シーラ城……まさか、君が<style=\"highlight\">ザン</style>なのか？","source_cn":"希莱城……等等，你是<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B01C3CC6A9B8ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1523508011:1":{"text":"……私を知ってるんですか？","source_cn":"……你认识我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83C088E91D2D34B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1523508012:1":{"text":"君の師であるパイオンは、私の古くからの友人なんだ。自慢の生徒だと、君の話はよく聞いていたよ。","source_cn":"你的老师，派翁，他是我的老友，经常和我提起你，说你是他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x659DC1EC3B37A05B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1523508013:1":{"text":"ほら、この徽章。きっと見覚えがあるだろう？","source_cn":"这是你老师分发给学生的徽章，你应该认得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB6834538036AC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::2":{"text":"ソヨゴの徽章","source_cn":"冬青徽章","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADF1B19A0768B45F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1523508014:1":{"text":"ソヨゴの徽章……確かにパイオン先生のものです。","source_cn":"冬青徽章……果然是老师的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC91C6DA1DFFDBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1523508015:0":{"text":"先生はホーリン城に引っ越されていたのですね？どうりでトータス町へ手紙を送っても返事が来ないわけだ……","source_cn":"派翁老师搬到呼临城来了吗？难怪我往他在图塔镇的地址寄信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A82BADD6BB9EEDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1523508016:1":{"text":"それが……君の先生や仲間たちは、豊穣神の堕落の影響で命を落としたと思われる……","source_cn":"……扎莱，你的老师和同学，大概率已经在丰饶神堕落带来的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2483E4D49D6C1349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1523508017:1":{"text":"え……今、何て……？","source_cn":"你……你说什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31A54B9003AAB506","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1523508018:0":{"text":"ビルボはこれまでの経緯を説明し、パイオンの手紙と研究記録をザンに手渡した。","source_cn":"比博解释了前因后果，将派翁的信与研究笔记一并递给了扎莱","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BEA791E30D88910","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1523508019:0":{"text":"彼女は記録を読みながら、次第に表情をこわばらせ、哀しみに沈んでいるように見えた……","source_cn":"扎莱翻阅着笔记，她的神态变得僵硬、哀伤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD84AB283BDBC3072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1523508020:0":{"text":"あなたたちは黙って、彼女が記録を読み終わるのを待った。","source_cn":"你们没有出声催促她，静静等待她阅读完老师最后的笔记","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A801C42D501B7CA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male