n……好吧，我会的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0644F6F97A2BC4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1523508026:1":{"text":"よかった！そなたの安全は余が保証する！護衛を二人……いや、三人つけよう！","source_cn":"太好了！我向你保证，一定会安排两个……不，三个！三个护...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3784B3DBB198770","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1523508027:1":{"text":"そんなに護衛は必要ありません。ですが、人手が必要なのは確かです。","source_cn":"我用不着那么多护卫。不过，我确实需要你们帮我再找点人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x493C75A15D5DFF1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1523508028:1":{"text":"先生の記録を読みましたが、研究の枠組みは整っているものの、実験の細部が詰められていませんでした。","source_cn":"我看了老师的笔记，虽然研究框架已经搭好，但各项实验都缺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F96B7EC38A4C93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1523508029:1":{"text":"私ひとりでは、とても完成させられません。だから、他の学者を集めるのを手伝ってほしいんです。","source_cn":"单凭我一个人，没法完成老师的改良计划。我需要你们帮忙召...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76C5B17ABF717783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1523508030:1":{"text":"問題ない。すぐに城中の学者を招集し、この研究に参加させよう！","source_cn":"没问题，我马上就下令，召集全城的学者，都参与这项研究！","st